{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42991","headline":"仲秋太常寺观公辂车拜陵 · 苗仲方","name":"仲秋太常寺观公辂车拜陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫初开律，金风已戒凉。\n拜陵将展敬，车辂俨成行。\n士庶观祠礼，公卿习旧章。\n郊原佳气引，园寝瑞烟长。\n卤簿辞丹阙，威仪列太常。\n圣心何所寄，惟德在无忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苗仲方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}